{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e44900c7f0a68139a07668c43abd58d190abe31398842c49c573e78552a63ad8","ja":"雪歩と恵美は、映画のコラボ企画となる\n謎解きアトラクションの先行体験に来ていて……","zh":"雪步和惠美前来先行体验\n作为电影联动企划的解谜游乐项目……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6844824dbde91f3efe3ccff77b630fb17f79ab0ceffd1b7328e650ca63644268","ja":"うわ～っ！　雰囲気ある～♪","zh":"哇～！好有气氛～♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"344693f59416ace83eaf2d11d7452e6b219ee593dec6c7b3e18518ac39249068","ja":"建物の中なのに、アタシ達の映画に\nこんなにそっくりにつくるなんて、すごいね！","zh":"明明是在建筑物里面，\n却能做得跟我们的电影这么像，真厉害啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b1c9e65df61b5e2aeb467cb5ee6dfaedf54ab817155176354c9880d0e4b5ee93","ja":"なんだか、本当に映画の世界に\n来ちゃったみたいだね♪","zh":"感觉就像真的来到了\n电影的世界里一样呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"837a99ac2e655659df122641c4edfe5cb90723248997eb040595af79020b7282","ja":"謎解きの解答用紙も、カラフルでデザイン凝ってるし。\n裏の絵が歯車になってるのも、超オシャレじゃん！","zh":"解谜的答题卡也色彩缤纷、设计得很用心。\n背面的图样是齿轮，这也太时髦了吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"da4e225d4596a83ebfc8e7ae603f3e77f1c375f3853294afa7d84907a100e4dd","ja":"こっちの懐中時計は、\n制限時間を計ってるんだっけ？","zh":"这个怀表，\n是在计限制时间的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3fdb6a3686d7c9232f9e742f06f36e51ed4938e7976f07d5e3cf630eeb689cc7","ja":"「街がロボットに侵攻されてて、針が一周するまでに\n謎を全部解かないと人類の負け」、なんだって。","zh":"“城市正遭受机器人侵略，在指针转完一圈前\n不把谜题全部解开的话就是人类输了”，据说是这样。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"706632eab9be81fcd98bd291682c025193b5cabbac7020b9b38369d361857c41","ja":"そっか～。なら、気を付けないとだね！\nやっぱ、やるなら完全クリアを目指したいし！","zh":"这样啊～。那就得小心点了呢！\n毕竟既然要做，还是想以完美通关为目标呀！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b2927f1949e6ff5a9f6eba10ace3227f33c0530efd89ad18aefca70c308151a4","ja":"うん！　力を合わせて頑張ろう！","zh":"嗯！齐心协力一起加油吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"fc5fc300d487efcc7ac66e6754b47c67204455455d94a76e4bd4ea863b7a9043","ja":"ふたりは順調に進んで……","zh":"两人进展得很顺利……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"0140d7db8a0aff8322008a975129325ef0db5bab40cdec3605eb9f9e4f625565","ja":"さっきの答えは『スチーム』……っと。\nこれで3問目だね。……あれ、上になにかあるの？","zh":"刚才的答案是“蒸汽”……好的。\n这样就是第3题了呢。……咦，上面有什么东西吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"7d420ca875ba138fd3668c0d4aec10d40cd289a8f8284f69cca9996db2b7256e","ja":"ん～……なんか、天井の大きな飛行船に\n描いてる絵が、さっき見たのと違うな～って。","zh":"嗯～……总觉得天花板上那艘大飞艇\n上面画的图画，跟刚才看到的不一样呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"0970cfecfe32b7b637e96c8fc0a18c7b247109f3b6a166792c315ef7e96ac5e1","ja":"あっ、本当だ……！\n恵美ちゃん、よく気づいたね！？","zh":"啊，真的耶……！\n惠美，你注意得真仔细呢！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1645.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"2cdc1396547bbe3066b1489542fa317864be1ddb3505785aab915776ab65bc5b","ja":"映画の時、飛行士役だったから、\nつい気になって見てたんだ。にゃははっ♪","zh":"因为演电影的时候当过飞行员，\n就不知不觉在关注呢。喵哈哈♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:58:26+00:00"}
